# Force LF on anything a Linux container executes. Git's autocrlf on Windows
# will otherwise rewrite these to CRLF, and a Dockerfile CMD or shell script
# with CRLF line endings fails at runtime with an opaque "not found" error.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
